  "title": "Butternut Squash-Pumpkin Spice Soup",
  "description": "For this recipe, a homemade, fall-inspired spice mix is added to roasted butternut squash, onion, and heavy cream to make a rich soup for your lineup.",
  "authors": [
    "Howard"
  ],
